# What Cloudflare's own tool reads a Worker's secrets from when it runs one
# locally. The Egma model gateway holds Egma's provider credentials, so a file
# of them must never be a file this repository can commit.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*

# A local override of the compose file, copied from the checked-in example.
docker-compose.override.yml

# What `egma self-host phone setup` leaves in a platform workspace: the
# platform's own configuration, which holds credentials, and the receipts
# beside it. A receipt carries no secret by construction — it is swept before
# it is written — but it is this deployment's history and not the product's.
.egma-platform/

.DS_Store

# Agent worktrees — full checkouts, never part of the repo
.claude/worktrees/
